:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[The 10th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''The 10th Angel''' is an [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]] enemy that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The 10th Angel
|image = E 395.png
|appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 9,000¢ - 35,550¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is one of the most powerful and strong among the EVA Angels. It uses attacks with extreme damage, 900 range, a relatively fast attack rate and the [[Omni Strike]] ability to lower its standing range against Cats to 400 and ensure they don't easily stop its advance. In addition, it's immune to all crowd control effects other than knockbacks from the Sniper the Cat item. It's recommended to bring some Ubers from the set that have EVA Angel Killer to make quick work of it.

==Strategy==
EVA Angel Killers at high enough levels can tank The 10th Angel's hits. [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] is also very good here thanks to his Metal property. Otherwise, time disposable fast units to chip it and slow down its advance. The more precise the timings, the better, or your disposable attackers will die for nothing and the boss will move forward.

